Personal Touch Courier - Ottawa Courier Service Website

This is a professional website for Personal Touch Courier, a local Ottawa-based courier and freight delivery service. The site is built with Astro for optimal performance and SEO.

Key Features:
- Static site generation with Astro
- Tailwind CSS for styling
- Lucide React icons
- Mobile responsive design
- SEO optimized with structured data
- Custom brand colors (PTC green, teal, beige)

Services Offered:
- Local Courier Delivery
- Local Freight Delivery
- Dedicated Transportation
- White Glove Logistics
